{"seq":2,"slug":"lithium-ion","title":"锂离子电池原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/batteries/lithium-ion","wordCount":1621,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"锂离子电池原理\">锂离子电池原理</h1><p>锂离子电池的精妙在于它根本不让锂金属真正析出，而是让锂离子像坐摇椅一样在正负极之间来回穿梭——充电时挤进负极的层状结构，放电时再回到正极。这个「摇椅」机制避开了金属锂枝晶刺穿隔膜的致命问题，让高能量与长寿命第一次同时成为可能，也因此撑起了今天的手机、电动车与电网储能。本篇拆解它的四大组件、嵌入脱出的电化学过程、SEI 膜这个隐形守护者，以及 2026 年正在改写格局的固态与钠电路线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>锂离子电池由四个核心部分构成：正极（含锂的过渡金属氧化物或磷酸盐）、负极（石墨或硅碳）、电解液（锂盐溶于有机溶剂）、隔膜（多孔绝缘膜，只让离子通过、阻止电极短路）。充放电的本质是锂离子在两极之间的嵌入（intercalation）与脱出，正负极都像「主体晶格」，锂离子是来去的客人。</p>\n<p>充电时锂离子从正极脱出、穿过电解液和隔膜、嵌入负极；放电时反向。电子则走外电路，与离子的路径分离——这正是 <a href=\"../fundamentals/cells-faraday\">电化学池与法拉第定律</a> 里「氧化还原拆分」思想的极致工程化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[充电: 外加电压] --&gt; B[正极锂离子脱出&lt;br/&gt;氧化]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Li+穿过电解液隔膜]&#10;  C --&gt; D[嵌入负极石墨&lt;br/&gt;还原]&#10;  D --&gt; E[电子走外电路&lt;br/&gt;与离子分离]&#10;  F[放电: 自发] --&gt; G[负极Li+脱出]&#10;  G --&gt; H[Li+回到正极]&#10;  H --&gt; I[电子经外电路供电]\">flowchart TD\n  A[充电: 外加电压] --&gt; B[正极锂离子脱出&lt;br/&gt;氧化]\n  B --&gt; C[Li+穿过电解液隔膜]\n  C --&gt; D[嵌入负极石墨&lt;br/&gt;还原]\n  D --&gt; E[电子走外电路&lt;br/&gt;与离子分离]\n  F[放电: 自发] --&gt; G[负极Li+脱出]\n  G --&gt; H[Li+回到正极]\n  H --&gt; I[电子经外电路供电]</pre><p>下表对比主流正极材料的特性（数据为典型量级）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>正极材料</th>\n<th>简称</th>\n<th>标称电压 / V</th>\n<th>比容量 / (mAh/g)</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>磷酸铁锂</td>\n<td>LFP</td>\n<td>3.2</td>\n<td>150~170</td>\n<td>安全、长寿命、廉价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镍钴锰三元</td>\n<td>NMC</td>\n<td>3.6~3.7</td>\n<td>160~200</td>\n<td>高能量密度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镍钴铝</td>\n<td>NCA</td>\n<td>3.6</td>\n<td>180~200</td>\n<td>高能量、特斯拉常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钴酸锂</td>\n<td>LCO</td>\n<td>3.7</td>\n<td>140~150</td>\n<td>早期 3C，热稳定性差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入脱出-摇椅机制的电化学\">嵌入脱出：摇椅机制的电化学</h2><p>以石墨负极、LFP 正极为例，充电时的两极半反应是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>正极</mtext><mo>:</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{正极}: \\mathrm{LiFePO_4} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{FePO_4} + \\mathrm{Li^+} + e^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">正极</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">LiFeP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FeP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>负极</mtext><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{负极}: 6\\mathrm{C} + \\mathrm{Li^+} + e^- \\rightarrow \\mathrm{LiC_6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">负极</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Li</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>锂离子嵌入石墨层间形成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{LiC_6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Li</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，理论上每 6 个碳原子容纳 1 个锂，对应石墨理论比容量约 372 mAh/g。整个过程晶格只发生小幅膨胀收缩，结构基本可逆，这是循环寿命长的根本。电池的工作电压就是正负极嵌锂电位之差，按 <a href=\"../fundamentals/nernst-equation\">能斯特方程</a> 它会随荷电状态（SOC）平缓变化，这条「电压-SOC」曲线是电池管理系统估算剩余电量的依据，与 <a href=\"../fundamentals/cells-faraday\">法拉第定律</a> 里的库仑计量互为补充。</p>\n<p>为何能做到 3.6 V 这么高的单体电压？因为锂的还原电势低至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3.04</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3.04\\,\\mathrm{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3.04</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>（见 <a href=\"../fundamentals/redox-electrode-potential\">氧化还原与电极电势</a>），与高电位正极配对，电压自然高，能量密度也随之领先。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sei-膜-隐形的守护者与寿命的关键\">SEI 膜：隐形的守护者与寿命的关键</h2><p>锂电的工作电压远超有机电解液的稳定窗口，理论上电解液会在负极被还原分解。幸运的是，首次充电时电解液在石墨表面分解，生成一层薄而致密的固态电解质界面膜（SEI）。这层膜电子绝缘、离子可透——它阻止电解液继续分解，又允许锂离子穿过，相当于一道「选择性护栏」。</p>\n<p>SEI 的形成正是 <a href=\"../kinetics/double-layer\">双电层与界面</a> 里界面钝化思想的具体体现，本质与 <a href=\"../applications/corrosion-protection\">腐蚀与防护</a> 中的钝化膜同源。SEI 的质量决定电池寿命：理想的 SEI 稳定、致密；但若反复破裂重生，会持续消耗锂离子和电解液，导致容量缓慢衰减——这正是库仑效率无法达到 100% 的微观原因。低温快充时锂离子来不及嵌入石墨，会在负极表面还原成金属锂（析锂），形成枝晶，这是安全事故的主因，也是 <a href=\"../kinetics/mass-transport-polarization\">传质与极化</a> 里「逼近极限电流」在电池中的危险后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全与热失控\">安全与热失控</h2><p>锂电的高能量密度是双刃剑。过充、内短路、机械挤压或高温都可能触发热失控：局部放热引起 SEI 分解、隔膜熔毁、正极释氧，进而连锁放热、起火甚至爆炸。工程上的防护是多层次的——隔膜的热关断特性、电解液阻燃添加剂、电池管理系统对电压电流温度的实时监控、以及单体间的物理隔离。LFP 之所以在储能和入门电动车里份额持续上升，关键就在于它的热稳定性远好于三元材料，更难释氧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-前沿-固态与钠电\">2026 前沿：固态与钠电</h2><p>2026 年锂电技术正处在两条路线的交汇点。固态电池用固态电解质替代易燃液态电解液，有望同时提升安全性与能量密度，目标能量密度可达 400<del>500 Wh/kg，远超当前约 250</del>300 Wh/kg 的液态锂电。但其最大难题是固-固界面接触差、制造良率低、成本高。截至 2026 年初，上汽 MG 已交付搭载半固态电池包的量产车，奔驰、宝马的全固态原型车在路试，丰田、日产则把全面量产目标定在 2028~2029 年，真正高量产更可能要到 2030 年代初（<a href=\"https://www.batterytechonline.com/industry-outlook/lithium-solid-state-batteries-in-2026-promise-physics-and-the-path-to-commercial-reality\">batterytechonline, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>另一条路线是钠离子电池，工作机理与锂电几乎同构（同样靠离子嵌入脱出），但用更廉价、储量丰富的钠替代锂。CATL 的钠电能量密度已达约 175 Wh/kg、计划 2026 年规模量产，详见 <a href=\"primary-secondary\">一次与二次电池</a>。两条路线分别瞄准「更高能量」与「更低成本+更宽温域」，预计将长期并存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>锂离子电池靠锂离子在正负极间嵌入脱出的「摇椅机制」工作，避免金属锂析出，兼得高能量与长寿命。</li>\n<li>四大组件为正极、负极、电解液、隔膜；石墨负极理论比容量约 372 mAh/g，正极材料决定电压与能量密度。</li>\n<li>单体高电压源于锂极低的还原电势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3.04</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3.04\\,\\mathrm{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3.04</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>；工作电压随 SOC 按能斯特关系平缓变化，支撑电量估算。</li>\n<li>SEI 膜是离子可透、电子绝缘的钝化层，与腐蚀钝化同源；其稳定性决定循环寿命，破损会持续耗锂、低温快充易析锂引发安全风险。</li>\n<li>2026 年固态电池（目标 400<del>500 Wh/kg，半固态已量产、全固态约 2028</del>2029 量产）与钠离子电池（约 175 Wh/kg、低成本宽温域）是两大前沿路线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"锂离子电池原理","id":"锂离子电池原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入脱出：摇椅机制的电化学","id":"嵌入脱出-摇椅机制的电化学"},{"level":2,"text":"SEI 膜：隐形的守护者与寿命的关键","id":"sei-膜-隐形的守护者与寿命的关键"},{"level":2,"text":"安全与热失控","id":"安全与热失控"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 前沿：固态与钠电","id":"2026-前沿-固态与钠电"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"一次与二次电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/batteries/primary-secondary"},"next":{"title":"燃料电池与超级电容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/batteries/fuel-cell-supercap"}}